TITLE Ba solution equilibration with talc+rhodochrosite+sepiolite+sepiolite(d)+Pb(OH)2 at 100C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ba   100
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc            0 10
    Rhodochrosite   0 10
    Sepiolite       0 10
    Sepiolite(d)    0 10
    Pb(OH)2         0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings m_CO3
    10 PUNCH MOL("CO3-2")
END
